name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q13_2025'

question 'A phone\'s "Do Not Disturb" mode blocks all notifications unless the message is marked as urgent. What kind of logic helps the phone decide when not to block a message?'

wrong 'An AND operator that blocks everything at all times'
right 'A NOT operator that allows messages through when they are not in the blocked category'
wrong 'An OR operator that chooses messages randomly to let through'
wrong 'A variable that stores how many texts you\'ve received today'

allow_multiple_attempts false

